  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Manual suggests the following endorsement for the relevant INN stem: “It is a condition of registration that any use in respect of pharmaceuticals will be limited to such goods containing substances belonging to the pharmacological group designated by the International Non- Proprietary Name stem <stem>.”",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part29/5/5/5",
          "quote": "The endorsement suggested by the Registrar in these circumstances is: It is a condition of registration that any use in respect of pharmaceuticals will be limited to such goods containing substances belonging to the pharmacological group designated by the International Non- Proprietary Name stem <stem>."
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is suggested where a mark for pharmaceuticals or veterinary substances consists of an INN stem, or meaningfully contains a notified INN stem, and the goods covered by the specification are not restricted to substances indicated by that stem.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part29/5/5/5",
          "quote": "A ground for rejection under section 43 exists where a trade mark to be used in relation to pharmaceuticals or veterinary substances consists of an INN stem, or contains a notified INN stem in a meaningful way, and use of the trade mark in respect of the goods covered by the specification are not restricted to substances indicated by the INN stem."
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the Manual's practice, the applicant's agreement to that condition of registration may overcome the section 43 ground for rejection.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part29/5/5/5",
          "quote": "A section 43 ground for rejection may be overcome by the applicant agreeing to a condition of registration limiting use of the trade mark to goods containing substances belonging to the relevant INN stem."
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    }
  ],
